oes not provide the ordered, tightly spaced interactions (<=600 units) needed to demonstrate a cascade, and exact event ordering along a multi-step path cannot be established from available temporal counts. Static/topological connectivity (step_01) and the nodes' activity levels (step_03) could suggest possible influence routes if time is ignored, but the temporal evidence does not support a time-respecting cascade here."}, "raw_final_response": "{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_06dfe96e\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [2644, 2786],\n  \"window\": [47628, 57228],\n  \"confidence\": 0.75,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"There is no direct 2644->2786 interaction in the window (step_02). 2644's outgoing contacts in the interval are only to nodes 2784 and 3486 (step_04), while 2786's incoming contacts in the same interval come from 109, 3294, and 5728 (step_06) \u2014 no overlap that would support a short time-respecting relay. Temporal-binned activity shows 2644's two events lie in different subintervals ([49001\u201350000] and [52001\u201353000], step_09) and 2786's four events occur at separate times ([48001\u201349000], [52001\u201353000], [54001\u201355000], [56001\u201357228], step_10); this does not provide the ordered, tightly spaced interactions (<=600 units) needed to demonstrate a cascade, and exact event ordering along a multi-step path cannot be established from available temporal counts. Static/topological connectivity (step_01) and the nodes' activity levels (step_03) could suggest possible influence routes if time is ignored, but the temporal evidence does not support a time-respecting cascade here.\"\n}", "total_input_tokens": 66500, "total_output_tokens": 5809, "total_tokens": 72309, "total_latency_ms": 82915, "llm_calls": 16, "schema_repairs": 0, "tool_protocol_errors": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}